Third-party protocol knowledge
------------------------------

Parts of the protocol handling are derived from the following projects. Files that
contain ported logic say so in their header.

* Solaar — Linux device manager for Logitech devices
  https://github.com/pwr-Solaar/Solaar
  License: GPL-2.0-or-later (used here under GPL-3.0-or-later)
  Used for: HID++ 1.0 receiver registers, HID++ 2.0 feature IDs and battery decoding.

* HeadsetControl — sidetone and battery for USB headsets
  https://github.com/Sapd/HeadsetControl
  License: GPL-3.0
  Used for: SteelSeries Arctis Nova Pro Wireless base station status request/response.

